      "updated": 1790085694345,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "18 DIMENSIONS — plain questions asked of that evidence\n\nwas it paid in full, partly, not at all, or twice?      did the cash arrive, arrive short, or never arrive?\nwhat did the TPA rule?      what did the manufacturer rule?      was it reversed or clawed back?",
      "originalText": "18 DIMENSIONS — plain questions asked of that evidence\n\nwas it paid in full, partly, not at all, or twice?      did the cash arrive, arrive short, or never arrive?\nwhat did the TPA rule?      what did the manufacturer rule?      was it reversed or clawed back?",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "baseFontSize": null,
